{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the Operator, an evil bio-computer, as the last hope for a world destroyed by the zombie apocalypse. Various people, including ninjas and farmers, set out on an adventure to save humanity. Explore the Dungeons with cute characters and defeat the oncoming zombies. Solve various traps and gimmicks and face the waiting bosses when you reach the end. Defeat it and obtain gold and gems A game where you strengthen your character using items and skills and challenge the next labyrinth.\u00a0 This is a trial version of Dungeon Destroyer. The trial version only allows you to play 3 out of 15 dungeons, which is about 20% of the content.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3453080?t=1740474389","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453080/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740474389","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453080/8aeeef26223468e9a8bb3d0053fd30a31509664f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740474389","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3453080/8aeeef26223468e9a8bb3d0053fd30a31509664f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740474389","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the Operator, an evil bio-computer, as the last hope for a world destroyed by the zombie apocalypse. Various people, including ninjas and farmers, set out on an adventure to save humanity. Explore the Dungeons with cute characters and defeat the oncoming zombies. Solve various traps and gimmicks and face the waiting bosses when you reach the end. Defeat it and obtain gold and gems A game where you strengthen your character using items and skills and challenge the next labyrinth.\u00a0 This is a trial version of Dungeon Destroyer. The trial versio